{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "8e9fcbff-fb72-85b2-888d-dd5f60a9766a",
  "created_at": "2025-12-01T11:18:31-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Kathleen Cullen",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:12:21-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:12:26-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, it's doing it again, the drain. I told them last year it was slow, and now it's worse. You know the one I mean."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:12:38-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, hang on, Ma'am, I don't have the one you mean just yet. Can you start with your name and where you are?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:12:49-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh. Kathleen Cullen. I'm at 466 Bliss Road, on the Easton's Beach side. The storm drain right in front of the house."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:13:00-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, Kathleen, 466 Bliss Road. And what's the drain doing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:13:06-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's grunting. That's the only word for it. It gurgles and grunts and the water just sits there. Then any time we get a thaw, the snow melts off and the whole thing backs up into the street. Right up over the curb."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:13:26-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so gurgling, slow, backs up when the snow melts. Is there a storm going on right now, or is it just dry out?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:13:37-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no storm. It's dry as a bone today. Hasn't rained in days. It's just sitting there with water in it. That's what bothers me, there's no reason for it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:13:51-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, so standing water even without weather. That's useful to know. [pause] Is it only the one drain, or are others on the block doing it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:14:03-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just mine, as far as I can see. The one in front of my place. I can't walk down to the corner like I used to, so I couldn't tell you about the others."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:14:19-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. Is the water getting near your house or yard, or is it staying in the road?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:14:28-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It stays in the road, mostly. But it comes up to the edge of the walk, and when it freezes at night it's a sheet of ice right where the mailman comes. I'm eighty-some years old, I don't need that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:14:46-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, I hear you. Ice on the walk is no good. So I'm writing this down: 466 Bliss Road, drain out front slow and backing up, standing water in dry weather, ices over at night."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:15:02-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it exactly. And I want to say, it was not this bad last winter. Last winter it was a little slow, sure, but it cleared. This year it doesn't clear."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:15:17-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so it's gotten worse since last year. That helps the crew know it's not a one-off."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:15:25-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You used to be able to call and Walter would know. Walter Pine, next door. He's gone now. He knew everybody on the block by name, every dog too. If something was wrong he'd already called somebody. Now it's me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:15:43-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sounds like he was a good one to have around. Well, you called the right place. I'll put this in as a drainage work order so somebody can go look at it and see if it's clogged or if there's something wrong underneath."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:16:03-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And who do I call if it doesn't get done? That's what I want to know. Who do I call to get it checked? Because last year I called and nobody ever came back to me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:16:20-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You can call right back here, to Public Works, and give them the address. I'll note on the order that this is a repeat from last year, so it doesn't just sit at the bottom of the pile. Do you want a call back when someone's been out?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:16:42-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please. I'd like to know. My phone's a cell, I'm on it now, it cuts out sometimes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:16:51-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. What's the best number to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:16:56-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 401-555-0194."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:16:58-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 401-555-0194. Reading that back to be sure: four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-nine-four."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:17:04-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. And if I'm not picking up, try again. I'm slow getting to the phone."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:17:12-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Will do, and they can leave a message too. Anything else about it? Any smell, or trash and leaves packed in the grate?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:17:23-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Some leaves, yes. A lot of them, from the fall. I can't bend down to pull them out. But I don't think it's only leaves. It makes a noise like something's stuck down there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:17:39-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'll put that in. Leaves on the grate and a noise like a blockage. That could mean the crew needs the vacuum truck, so I'll flag it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:17:52-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Because I've been telling people for two weeks that it's going to freeze solid and then what."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:18:01-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, understood. I can't tell you the exact day, but I'm marking it for this week, since it's icing over. If it gets worse before then, or someone slips, call us right away."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:18:16-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I will. I'll call every day if I have to. Thank you, Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:18:23-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure thing, Kathleen. You take care and watch your step out there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:18:29-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I will. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
